    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48946" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θολ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make turbid</i>, prop. of water, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ.
