				Antiph.
				26.2
			</span></i>; of fishermen, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				311
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεθολωμένα ὕδατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
				</span></i>
